    "04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "6 Person Meeting Booths, Collaborative, Private, and Purpose-Built for Modern Workspaces "
          }
        },
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Discover our <strong>6 Person Meeting Booth collection</strong>, expertly designed to deliver privacy, productivity, and acoustic comfort in today’s modern office environments. Whether you are fitting out a <strong>corporate headquarters</strong>, <strong>co-working hub</strong>, or <strong>hybrid workspace</strong>, these premium office pods provide dedicated areas for <strong>team collaboration</strong>, <strong>confidential meetings</strong>, and <strong>focused work</strong> without the need for costly construction or renovation. </p><p><strong><br/>Why Choose Our 6 Person Office Booths</strong> </p><p><strong>Enhanced Team Productivity</strong>  Our six person booths create distraction-free environments where ideas can flow and teams can focus without interruption, improving both collaboration and performance. </p><p><strong>Exceptional Acoustic Privacy</strong>  Each booth is constructed with advanced soundproofing materials and acoustic seals, reducing noise transfer and ensuring that private conversations remain confidential. </p><p><strong>Fast Installation and Modular Design</strong>  Avoid lengthy build times. Our modular office pods can be assembled quickly and repositioned easily, making them ideal for flexible and fast-moving workplaces. </p><p><strong>Comfort Meets Functionality</strong>  Every booth includes efficient ventilation, soft LED lighting, and ergonomic furniture to create a comfortable, productive setting for meetings and collaboration. </p><p><strong>Adaptable for Any Space</strong>  Whether you need a booth for brainstorming sessions, client meetings, or hybrid collaboration, our range can be tailored to your workspace layout and design preferences. </p><p> <br/><strong>What Sets Our 6 Person Meeting Pods Apart</strong> </p><ul><li><strong>Mobility and Flexibility:</strong> Lightweight structures with optional wheels for effortless movement. </li><li><strong>Tech-Ready Interiors:</strong> Integrated power sockets, USB ports, and connectivity options to support hybrid and digital workflows. </li><li><strong>Verified Acoustic Performance:</strong> Independently tested to ISO 23351-1 standards for proven speech reduction and sound insulation. </li><li><strong>Modern, Ergonomic Design:</strong> Crafted with premium materials and contemporary styling that complements any professional environment. </li><li><strong>Sustainable by Design:</strong> Built with recyclable components, energy-efficient lighting, and eco-conscious manufacturing processes. </li></ul><p> <br/><strong>Maximising Your Office Booth Investment</strong> </p><ul><li><strong>Strategic Placement:</strong> Position booths close to collaborative areas but away from busy corridors to balance accessibility and privacy. </li><li><strong>Defined Use Cases:</strong> Allocate booths for specific purposes such as team meetings, client discussions, or focused project work. </li><li><strong>User Feedback:</strong> Gather employee input and adjust booth placement or configuration based on real-world usage and experience. </li></ul><p> <br/><strong>The Advantage of Acoustic Office Booths</strong> </p><p>Open-plan offices can reduce employee concentration and cognitive performance by up to 70 per cent due to noise and visual distractions. Integrating <strong>acoustically optimised meeting booths</strong> can restore focus, improve wellbeing, and increase overall workplace satisfaction. </p><p><strong><br/>Explore Our Meeting Booth Range</strong> </p><ul><li><strong>Solo Focus Pods:</strong> Designed for individual work or private calls. </li><li><strong>2–4 Person Pods:</strong> Ideal for one-to-one meetings or small group discussions. </li><li><strong>6 Person Booths:</strong> Spacious, private, and perfect for collaborative sessions and team discussions. </li></ul><p>Each model is available with a selection of <strong>custom finishes</strong>, <strong>acoustic ratings</strong>, and <strong>technology options</strong> to help you find the perfect fit for your workspace. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
