    "9b3f8f21-95ee-4331-a1eb-6df3746f9449": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "384182ef-0772-42c3-be48-f16f826fa4a0": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the dimensions of the Quell 6 Person Meeting Booth?",
            "text": "<p>The Quell 6 Person Meeting Booth is designed to provide ample space for collaborative meetings. Its interior dimensions measure: </p><ul><li>Height: 214cm</li><li>Width: 204cm</li><li>Depth: 210cm. </li></ul><p>This ensures that your team has plenty of room to work comfortably.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16818216698081__9b3f8f21-95ee-4331-a1eb-6df3746f9449-question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I customise the interior of the 6 Person Meeting Booths to match our office's style and functionality?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, you can! At Soundbox Store, we offer customisation options that let you personalise the interior of your 6 Person Meeting Booths to align with your office's unique style and functional needs. Whether you envision a traditional conference room layout or a more creative and open workspace, we can bring your vision to life.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16818216698081__9b3f8f21-95ee-4331-a1eb-6df3746f9449-question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does assembly take?",
            "text": "<p>Soundbox Store's large 6-person meeting/conference booth is designed for easy and logical assembly. However, we highly recommend using our qualified and insured installers for a seamless setup. Once fully unpacked, installation typically takes up to 3 hours, ensuring your 6-person acoustic pod is expertly assembled and ready for use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "9db25c39-b697-42aa-a02f-444c6e897ebe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the acoustic performance of the 6 Person Meeting Booth compare to smaller pods?",
            "text": "<p>The acoustic performance of our 6 Person Meeting Booth is exceptional, just like our smaller pods. It offers top-tier soundproofing to ensure that confidential discussions and presentations remain private and undisturbed. The larger size of this pod is designed to accommodate more team members without compromising on acoustic quality, making it an ideal choice for collaborative meetings on a larger scale.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_nyCWPN": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Power supply set up, do we need to do any thing?",
            "text": "<p>No. All our booths come with a 13amp power supply which plugs into the side of the booth with standard insert. Plug into your wall socket with locally supplied wall plug. If you are purchasing in UK, Europe or the US you will be supplied with local wall socket and correct electrical certificated components CE / UL Certificated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RzzGCH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do the meeting and phone booths connect to power?",
            "text": "<p>Our meeting and phone booths require simple installation, we recommend using our professional installation team. Each booth features a built-in power inlet on the side with an integrated 13-amp fused spur. Once assembled, the included 2-metre cable simply plugs into a standard mains socket, making setup simple.</p>"
          }
        },
        "73aa4999-6a1d-48cb-8d71-404272acec31": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is special electric power supply required?",
            "text": "<p>All of our meeting and phone booths are plug and play, meaning once built there is an insert for a 13amp cable on the side of the booth which approximately 2 metres long. This is the simply plugged into your normal power socket. <br/><br/>(UAE, UK / USA, Euro, Swiss supplied depending on the delivery address.)</p>"
          }
        }
      },
